  "slug": "bar-service-checklist-form",
  "title": "Bar Service Checklist Form",
  "subtitle": "Verify authorized bar readiness before opening, monitor service controls, record stop conditions, and reconcile the operation at close.",
  "description": "An original staged checklist for event beverage operations. It verifies the current order, responsible review, station setup, staff briefing, nonalcoholic support, custody controls, mid-service observations, exceptions, and closing handoff without claiming regulatory certification.",
  "use_case": "Use during the pre-open briefing, operating checks, and station close. Checking an item records that the assigned reviewer observed the stated condition; it does not replace individual service judgment. Open an exception for any failed check and hold opening when a stop condition remains.",
  "risk_tier": "B",
