          "key": "checklist_boundary",
          "type": "notice",
          "label": "Checklist authority boundary",
          "guidance": "A completed check documents the observed operating state; it does not certify legal compliance, determine a guest's age or condition, or direct service to a specific person. Follow the current applicable policy and escalate uncertain identification, service, safety, or guest situations to the responsible role."
        }
